    "raw_output": "public final class Solution {\n    public static Long boundedPrefixSum(long[] values, long bound) {\n        if (values == null || values.length == 0) {\n            return null;\n        }\n        long currentSum = 0;\n        for (long value : values) {\n            currentSum += value;\n            if (currentSum < -bound || currentSum > bound) {\n                return null;\n            }\n        }\n        return currentSum;\n    }\n}<|im_end|>",
